To the extent MAMUT-routing holds the relevant rights, the MAMUT-routing curation artifacts in this directory are distributed under the MIT License below.

This family curates time-dependent VRPTW benchmark material originating from Solomon (1987), the time-dependent extension of Dabia et al. (2013) under the Ichoua et al. (2003) travel-time model, and the instance distribution of Lera-Romero et al. (2020). It also curates the time-dependent VRP (TDVRP) variant of the same benchmark (the same material with time windows removed). This license notice does not claim to relicense third-party benchmark definitions or third-party best-known solution sources beyond the rights held by MAMUT-routing contributors.

